### ====================================================================
### 13. MOTOR A - SLIDING GATE (2d566d0a-f7d6-4fac-a0bf-18912da4ab28)
### ====================================================================
### 13.1 CỔNG TRƯỢT - MỞ (OPEN)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/devices/{{gateId}}/command
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "action": "OPEN"
}

### 13.2 CỔNG TRƯỢT - DỪNG (STOP)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/devices/{{gateId}}/command
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "action": "STOP"
}

### 13.3 CỔNG TRƯỢT - ĐÓNG (CLOSE)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/devices/{{gateId}}/command
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "action": "CLOSE"
}

### 13.4 CỔNG TRƯỢT - CẤU HÌNH THỜI GIAN MỞ RIÊNG (2000ms / 2s)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/devices/{{gateId}}/command
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "action": "SET_OPEN_DURATION",
  "openDurationMs": 2000
}

### 13.5 CỔNG TRƯỢT - CẤU HÌNH THỜI GIAN ĐÓNG RIÊNG (1900ms / 1.9s)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/devices/{{gateId}}/command
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "action": "SET_CLOSE_DURATION",
  "closeDurationMs": 1900
}

### 13.6 CỔNG TRƯỢT - CẤU HÌNH SỐ VÒNG QUAY (Mở 4 vòng, Đóng 3.8 vòng)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/devices/{{gateId}}/command
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "action": "SET_TURNS",
  "openTurns": 4.0,
  "closeTurns": 3.8
}

