Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "action": "STOP"
}

### 14.3 CỬA CUỐN / RÈM - ĐÓNG / HẠ XUỐNG (CLOSE)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/devices/{{doorId}}/command
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "action": "CLOSE"
}

### 14.4 CỬA CUỐN / RÈM - CẤU HÌNH THỜI GIAN MỞ / CUỘN LÊN RIÊNG (2000ms / 2s)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/devices/{{doorId}}/command
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "action": "SET_OPEN_DURATION",
  "openDurationMs": 2000
